a21d49ec37c4c50130f4353c6524c922.webm?t=1772096175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693580/extras/a21d49ec37c4c50130f4353c6524c922.mp4?t=1772096175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 30 different resources that can be gathered, crafted, traded, or stolen, your goblins will always have plenty of work to do. Assign goblins to jobs based on their personal traits - good or bad - and employ Enforcers to keep them in line!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the harsh winters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693580/extras/68e48fde672177715d4de42e8a995bfc.poster.avif?t=1772096175\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693580/extras/68e48fde672177715d4de42e8a995bfc.webm?t=1772096175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693580/extras/68e48fde672177715d4de42e8a995bfc.mp4?t=1772096175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger lurks around every corner. Defend your tribe from roaming monsters, skeletons, and other enemies by assigning guard goblins, hiring wandering heroes, and appealing to the gods for help. And if that doesn't cut it, your goblins will be more than happy to hide indoors until the threat passes! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore and Raid </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693580/extras/dea8414e1f5abd34a8cada8631e11f0f.poster.avif?t=1772096175\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_